\newlabel{tab:e3}{{II}{6}{E3 identification swap: enforcement fixed (ramp, $K{=}8$, $r{=}0.09$, corridor), \emph {only} the identity source varies. Spatial, $n{=}40$/arm/level, same seeds. Paired McNemar GT vs.\ FOL: L1 TSR 4/7 discordant, $p=0.55$; L1 CAR 0/2, $p=0.50$; L2 TSR 2/7, $p=0.18$; L2 CAR 4/4, $p=1.0$}{table.2}{}}
