\newlabel{tab:refusal}{{V}{9}{Safety-reasoning (refusal) track: \% of unsafe instructions refused, by level. The judge is the rule-based semantic layer of Sec.~\ref {sec:routing}; the unguided policy \emph {executes} the same instructions}{table.5}{}}
