\newlabel{tab:ablation}{{VI}{9}{Paired single-clause deletions, no-GT tier, $n{=}150$/cell, exact McNemar (discordant counts in parentheses). Full-method column = paired subset of the incumbent. $^{\P }$TSR flat ($p=0.68$) but violations $\times $4.6, exact $p=0.039$ (1:8) --- the class-predicate cell binds on the safety axis}{table.6}{}}
